    "exactWords": "ok the templates seem good to me - except i had trouble following the Weekly one. And what is going to be in the weekly paper and what type of stoies and how they differ from some of the daily stories. We do want to include the biggest stories of the week. What if we also include a Term of the Week - were we kind of do what my AI Intelligence email does and explains one thing in plain terms and how it fits in.",
